    "ct": "application/json",
    "body": "[{\"title\":\"Pole Inspections and Treating\",\"truncated_title\":\"Pole Inspections and Treating\",\"content\":\"Rayle EMC contractor, Southeastern Wood Pole Inspectors Inc. will be inspecting and treating poles. Personnel will be on foot and ATVs checking poles in yards, wooded areas, and along the right-of-way. Beginning in September they will be working in Oglethorpe, Wilkes, Lincoln, and Taliaferro Counties. Please contact Rayle EMC with questions or concerns at 706-678-2116.\",\"html_content\":\"<p>Rayle EMC contractor, Southeastern Wood Pole Inspectors Inc. will be inspecting and treating poles. Personnel will be on foot and ATVs checking poles in yards, wooded areas, and along the right-of-way. Beginning in September they will be working in Oglethorpe, Wilkes, Lincoln, and Taliaferro Counties. Please contact Rayle EMC with questions or concerns at 706-678-2116.<\\/p>\\n\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/rayleemc.com\\/about-us\\/news\\/pole-inspections-and-treating\",\"link_target\":\"_self\",\"created\":\"3 years ago\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Rayle EMC\"},\"media\":{\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":\"image\\/webp\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/rayleemc.com\\/uploads\\/blog\\/articles\\/5\\/original\\/77de68daecd823babbb58edb1c8e14d7106e83bb.webp\"}}},{\"title\":\"Herbicide Spraying\",\"truncated_title\":\"Herbicide Spraying\",\"content\":\"Rayle EMC contractor, Marshfield Forest Services Inc will be spraying herbicide on the powerline right of ways. Personnel will be on foot with backpack sprayers in yards, wooded areas and along the right-of-way. Please contact Rayle EMC with questions or concerns at 706-678-2116.\",\"html_content\":\"<p>Rayle EMC contractor, Marshfield Forest Services Inc will be spraying herbicide on the powerline right of ways. Personnel will be on foot with backpack sprayers in yards, wooded areas and along the right-of-way. Please contact Rayle EMC with questions or concerns at 706-678-2116.<\\/p>\\n\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/rayleemc.com\\/about-us\\/news\\/herbicide-spraying\",\"link_target\":\"_self\",\"created\":\"3 years ago\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Rayle EMC\"}},{\"title\":\"USPS Mail Delivery Changes\",\"truncated_title\":\"USPS Mail Delivery Changes\",\"content\":\"The United States Postal Service is making a change in the way they deliver first-class mail. This change could impact the delivery of your paper bill. E-Bill delivery is available as well as online payment and automatic draft options. Log in to your account or call your local office to learn about ways to manage your account so you don\\u2019t miss a payment. Please note that if you use your...\",\"html_content\":\"<p>The United States Postal Service is making a change in the way they deliver first-class mail. This change could impact the delivery of your paper bill. E-Bill delivery is available as well as online payment and automatic draft options. Log in to your account or call your local office to learn about ways to manage your account so you don\\u2019t miss a payment. Please note that if you use your...<\\/p>\\n\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/rayleemc.com\\/about-us\\/news\\/usps-mail-delivery-changes\",\"link_target\":\"_self\",\"created\":\"3 years ago\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Rayle EMC\"}}]"
